#: ../../source/docs/user-alerts-developer.rst:7
#: 4339743f50f2478baaa0d67e02108558
msgid "A User Alert is a formal report of an ArduPilot issue that may affect the safe operation of a vehicle. An \"issue\" is typically a bug report or GitHub Issue. \"Safe Operation\" is the ability of a vehicle to reliably respond to user commands in a timely manner AND the ability of the vehicle to reliably follow commanded actions in automated flight modes."
msgstr ""

